{"id":"92bb081cf777d22b","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-subset-type.md","title":"Eq 纤维化中的满子类型","display":"df-subset-type — Eq 纤维化中的满子类型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-subset-type","aliases":["16-df-subset-type","Subset type"],"display":"df-subset-type — Eq 纤维化中的满子类型","depends_on":["[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]","[[16-df-full-comprehension]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Definition4.6.1 and Lemma4.6.2 pp.274–276 (PDF294–296)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-subset-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-subset-type</span><span>Subset type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subset-type — Eq 纤维化中的满子类型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dfea0d23e394e93b\" href=\"?note=dfea0d23e394e93b\" title=\"16-df-full-comprehension\">16-df-full-comprehension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition4.6.1 and Lemma4.6.2 pp.274–276 (PDF294–296)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\)</span>，选定重索引、纤维终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_I\">\\(\\top_I\\)</span> 及纤维序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_I\">\\(\\le_I\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^\\to\">\\(\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^\\to\\)</span> 为候选理解函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\">\\(\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dfea0d23e394e93b\" href=\"?note=dfea0d23e394e93b\" title=\"16-df-full-comprehension\">16-df-full-comprehension</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubsetComp}\">\\(\\mathsf{SubsetComp}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}\">\\(\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}\\)</span> 如下定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}(p,\\chi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}(p,\\chi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\\Rightarrow\n\\left[(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ \\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}(\\pi_X)\\ \\land\n(\\forall u:I\\to J)(\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal E_J)\n\\left(\\top_I\\le_Iu^*Y\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists!h:I\\to\\{Y\\})\\ \\pi_Yh=u\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\\Rightarrow\n\\left[(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ \\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}(\\pi_X)\\ \\land\n(\\forall u:I\\to J)(\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal E_J)\n\\left(\\top_I\\le_Iu^*Y\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists!h:I\\to\\{Y\\})\\ \\pi_Yh=u\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本页修正原稿把 §4.6 的 subset types 混为带依赖证明项的集合型。这里的纤维是预序，子类型来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\dashv\\{-\\}\">\\(\\top\\dashv\\{-\\}\\)</span>；full 指理解函子满忠实，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 不可省略。它与第10章一般理解结构不同，不能从任意 comprehension category 推出。</p>\n<p>Lemma4.6.2 的证明已读：伴随把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:I\\to\\{Y\\}\">\\(h:I\\to\\{Y\\}\\)</span> 转置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_I\\to Y\">\\(\\top_I\\to Y\\)</span>，其基箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_Yh\">\\(\\pi_Yh\\)</span>，再由笛卡尔提升识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_I\\to u^*Y\">\\(\\top_I\\to u^*Y\\)</span>。对固定基箭头，预序性使后者至多一个，故因子唯一。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_Xv=\\pi_Xw\">\\(\\pi_Xv=\\pi_Xw\\)</span>，两个转置有同一基箭头，预序性推出转置相同，再由伴随推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=w\">\\(v=w\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X\">\\(\\pi_X\\)</span> 单。命题条件和结构数据已在前两节给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-with-unit","status":"resolved","id":"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-full-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"dfea0d23e394e93b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-full-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 满足 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的 $\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)$，选定重索引、纤维终对象 $\\top_I$ 及纤维序 $\\le_I$。$\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^\\to$ 为候选理解函子，$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-with-unit","status":"resolved","id":"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]，$\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]。$\\mathrm{Mono}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]；$\\mathsf{SubsetComp}$ 与 $\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}$ 如下定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-full-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"dfea0d23e394e93b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]，$\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]。$\\mathrm{Mono}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]；$\\mathsf{SubsetComp}$ 与 $\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}$ 如下定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]，$\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]。$\\mathrm{Mono}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]；$\\mathsf{SubsetComp}$ 与 $\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}$ 如下定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SubsetComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}(p,\\chi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\\Rightarrow\n\\left[(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ \\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}(\\pi_X)\\ \\land\n(\\forall u:I\\to J)(\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal E_J)\n\\left(\\top_I\\le_Iu^*Y\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists!h:I\\to\\{Y\\})\\ \\pi_Yh=u\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\top\\dashv\\{-\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"h:I\\to\\{Y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_I\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_Yh","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_I\\to u^*Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_Xv=\\pi_Xw","display":false},{"tex":"v=w","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X","display":false}],"bytes":2284,"backlinks":[{"id":"cca2b066cf07f3e7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$、$\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}$ 满足 [[16-df-subset-type]] 的 $\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)$；$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$，并采用该结构指定的重索引、有限积与纤维序。$I,J$ 为基对象，$q:I\\times J\\to I$、$r:I\\times J\\to J$ 为所选积的投影族；$q,r,a,b$ 均随 $I,J$ 变化并省略参数下标。$a,b:I\\times(J\\times J)\\to I\\times J$ 如下定义。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-subset-type]]、[[16-df-unique-choice]]、[[16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal]]、[[16-thm-sub-characterization]]、[[16-thm-split-replacement]]。分裂替代采用与其断言一致的文件名；其结论是纤维等价与指定分裂的构造。"},{"id":"d2e1d180cc0ebd2e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假设 $\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)$，采用 [[16-df-subset-type]]。$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}$ 是 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]] 中待刻画的谓词，未预先假设成立；$\\operatorname{Eq}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$e_I,\\delta_I$ 及 $\\kappa_I$ 如下定义，$\\pi_1,\\pi_2$ 为 $I\\times I$ 的所选投影。"},{"id":"775a56acaa867972","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["478c99d853e13c93","7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","dfea0d23e394e93b","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}